      "longDescription": "The classic Snake game reimagined with neon graphics. Eat food, grow longer, and avoid hitting walls or yourself.\n\nFeatures:\n- Smooth controls (swipe or arrow keys)\n- High score tracking\n- Neon visual effects\n- Speed increases as you grow",
      "category": "game",
